        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <i>QBob</i> like you never have before in this modernized version of the 1996 shareware classic with updated graphics, music, sounds, levels, and gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help QBob leap from rock to rock as he surveys an array of strangely shaped asteroids, all while avoiding a host of alien creatures—each more devious than the last. The job's not done until all the cubes have been marked for demolition. Hit the big red button and skedaddle to your escape rocket before the <strong>Big</strong> <strong>Kaboom!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>QBob: Remastered</i> is an action/arcade game, filled with strange space landscapes and bizarre, deadly alien creatures. Prepare to have your nerves jangled and your senses overloaded: the only sound you can hear is the beating of your own heart... <i>that is, until you hear your helmet cracking!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 unique levels: 20 from the original game plus 12 brand new bonus levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty settings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable keyboard controls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and gamepad support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A groovin' soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful characters, art and environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school arcade intermissions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop culture references that were dated even in 1996!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781720/extras/5332498ea874307c1dc909ffa3d7a912.avif?t=1782407504\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <i>QBob</i> like you never have before in this modernized version of the 1996 shareware classic with updated graphics, music, sounds, levels, and gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help QBob leap from rock to rock as he surveys an array of strangely shaped asteroids, all while avoiding a host of alien creatures—each more devious than the last. The job's not done until all the cubes have been marked for demolition. Hit the big red button and skedaddle to your escape rocket before the <strong>Big</strong> <strong>Kaboom!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>QBob: Remastered</i> is an action/arcade game, filled with strange space landscapes and bizarre, deadly alien creatures. Prepare to have your nerves jangled and your senses overloaded: the only sound you can hear is the beating of your own heart... <i>that is, until you hear your helmet cracking!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 unique levels: 20 from the original game plus 12 brand new bonus levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty settings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable keyboard controls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and gamepad support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A groovin' soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful characters, art and environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school arcade intermissions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop culture references that were dated even in 1996!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781720/extras/5332498ea874307c1dc909ffa3d7a912.avif?t=1782407504\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p>",
